    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34784" root="فود" body-key="f">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استفادهُ</span></b> , (M, L, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">افادهُ</span></b> , (M, K,)
[respecting which latter see 10 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فيد</span>,] as
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تقيّد</span>, (K, [but this belongs to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فيد</span> only,])
<i>He gained it, acquired it,</i> or <i>got it, for himself,</i>
namely, property [&amp;c.]. (M, L, K.) [See more
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فيد</span>.]

